<title>Detours Redesign Board</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Hanken+Grotesk:wght@400;500;600;700&amp;family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500&amp;display=swap">
<style>
/*__CSS__*/
</style>

<div class="board">
  <header class="top">
    <div class="title">
      <div class="eyebrow">Detours · redesign · 2 Oct 2026</div>
      <h1>Detours Redesign Board</h1>
      <p>Three directions for macOS 27 Golden Gate, drawn with the screenshot fixture: acme-corp on the left, taskflow/api on devtest on the right. Every direction keeps the agreed defaults: stock file icons, inset rounded selection, no banding, SF Pro with aligned digits, compact rows.</p>
    </div>
  </header>

  <div class="controls" role="toolbar" aria-label="Mockup controls">
    <div class="ctl"><span>Direction</span>
      <div class="seg" id="ctl-dir">
        <button type="button" id="dir-a" data-v="a">Golden Gate</button>
        <button type="button" id="dir-b" data-v="b">Quiet Pro</button>
        <button type="button" id="dir-c" data-v="c">Instrument</button>
        <button type="button" id="dir-all" data-v="all">All three</button>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="ctl"><span>Appearance</span>
      <div class="seg" id="ctl-app">
        <button type="button" id="app-light" data-v="light">Light</button>
        <button type="button" id="app-dark" data-v="dark">Dark</button>
        <button type="button" id="app-both" data-v="both">Both</button>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="ctl"><span>Accent</span>
      <div class="seg" id="ctl-acc">
        <button type="button" id="acc-detours" data-v="detours">Detours</button>
        <button type="button" id="acc-blue" data-v="blue">Blue</button>
        <button type="button" id="acc-graphite" data-v="graphite">Graphite</button>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="ctl"><span>Density</span>
      <div class="seg" id="ctl-den">
        <button type="button" id="den-compact" data-v="compact">Compact</button>
        <button type="button" id="den-comfortable" data-v="comfortable">Comfortable</button>
        <button type="button" id="den-spacious" data-v="spacious">Spacious</button>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="ctl"><span>Active pane</span>
      <div class="seg" id="ctl-pane">
        <button type="button" id="pane-left" data-v="left">Left</button>
        <button type="button" id="pane-right" data-v="right">Right</button>
      </div>
    </div>
    <button type="button" class="toggle" id="ctl-qn" aria-pressed="false">Quick Nav ⌘P</button>
  </div>

  <main class="views" id="views"></main>

  <footer class="note">Glass is drawn with CSS blur as an approximation of Liquid Glass; on macOS 14 and 15 Golden Gate falls back to the opaque sidebar and titlebar materials. Accent follows the macOS accent setting; "Detours" is the app's own accent, used when macOS is set to Multicolor. Icons are image-generation concepts; the shipped icon is redrawn as Icon Composer layers.</footer>
</div>

<script>
/*__JS__*/
</script>
